<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>%lld장을 융합했어요</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Fused %#@cards@</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld cards</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld장을 모두 융합할까요?</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Fuse %#@cards@?</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>all %lld cards</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>가져올 세이브: 카드 %lld종 · %@
(%@, v%@)
지금 세이브: 카드 %lld종 · %@

지금 세이브는 세이브 폴더에 자동 백업돼요.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Save to import: %1$#@new@ · %2$@
(%3$@, v%4$@)
Current save: %5$#@old@ · %6$@

Your current save will be backed up to the save folder automatically.</string>
		<key>new</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld cards</string>
		</dict>
		<key>old</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld cards</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld팩마다 랜덤 부스터 1팩</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>1 random Booster Pack %#@packs@</string>
		<key>packs</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>every pack</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>every %lld packs</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld / %lld장 보유 · 메인 덱 %lld~%lld장</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%1$lld / %2$lld owned · Main Deck %3$lld–%4$#@cards@</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld cards</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key> (%lld장)</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string> (%#@cards@)</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld card</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld cards</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>같은 카드를 %lld장 모으면 오버프레임 그림이 해금돼요</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Collect %#@cards@ of this card to unlock its overframe artwork</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld copy</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld copies</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>이미 모은 카드는 그대로예요. 오버프레임 그림이 있는 카드는 해금하는 %lld장까지 남기고, 융합에 필요한 소재도 남겨요.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Cards you already own stay in your collection. Cards with overframe artwork are kept until you have the %#@cards@ that unlock it, and the materials you need for Fusion are kept too.</string>
		<key>cards</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld copy</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld copies</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
